            "uco-core:description": "Federal prosecution of six defendants for operating and participating in Greggy's Cult, an Internet-based child exploitation enterprise charged under 18 U.S.C. \u00a7 2252A(g). Filed 2025-11-18 under seal in the United States District Court for the Eastern District of New York (Brooklyn), assigned to Judge Pamela K. Chen. Source: PACER criminal docket sheet, caption and Pending Counts; Source: PACER Doc 8 (redacted indictment), caption.",
